# Keep the corpus byte-exact on every platform. synthetic.pdf is pure ASCII
# (ASCII85 streams), so without this git would treat it as text and a Windows
# checkout with core.autocrlf could rewrite its line endings and break the
# xref offsets. The SHA-256 values in SOURCES.md also assume exact bytes.
*.pdf binary
*.jpg binary
*.json -text
*.sh text eol=lf
